WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:21.858
"Aah!" shouted Roxy. "I'm trapped in a bubble!"

2
00:00:21.859 --> 00:00:25.869
The bubble drifted high in the sky.

3
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.882
Looking down, Roxy could see the robot stomping on a bus.

4
00:00:29.883 --> 00:00:34.151
The robot was on its way to Metro City Bank!

5
00:00:34.152 --> 00:00:36.855
"Oh no!" thought Roxy.

6
00:00:36.856 --> 00:00:41.744
"I have to stop that robot before it steals Metro City Bank!"

7
00:00:41.745 --> 00:00:45.916
She hit the bubble's wall as hard as she could.

8
00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:49.329
Boing! Boing! Boing!

9
00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:53.214
Roxy bounced around inside the bubble for a few moments.

10
00:00:53.215 --> 00:00:55.275
She hit the bubble again.

11
00:00:55.276 --> 00:01:01.216
Boing! Boing! Boing!

12
00:01:01.217 --> 00:01:05.353
Whiz-hoo! Roxy shot lasers from her eyes.

13
00:01:05.354 --> 00:01:09.126
Boing! Boing! Boing!

14
00:01:09.127 --> 00:01:12.547
"Aah!" shouted Roxy in frustration.

15
00:01:12.548 --> 00:01:16.820
She ducked and jumped as the laser bounced around the bubble.

16
00:01:16.821 --> 00:01:19.048
"Whew!" cried Roxy.

17
00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:21.474
"That was a terrible idea.

18
00:01:21.475 --> 00:01:25.258
Maybe my heat vision will work."

19
00:01:25.259 --> 00:01:28.414
An orange beam radiated from Roxy's eyes.

20
00:01:28.415 --> 00:01:30.462
The beam didn't bounce.

21
00:01:30.463 --> 00:01:33.495
But now the bubble was filled with smoke!

22
00:01:33.496 --> 00:01:36.330
Roxy stopped her heat vision.

23
00:01:36.331 --> 00:01:39.116
She looked at the spot she had tried to burn.

24
00:01:39.117 --> 00:01:41.382
There was no damage at all.

25
00:01:41.383 --> 00:01:44.375
By now she was far above Metro City.

26
00:01:44.376 --> 00:01:48.010
She saw the robot standing in front of Metro City Bank.

27
00:01:48.011 --> 00:01:50.939
Without thinking, Roxy shot toward the robot.

28
00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:52.783
And the bubble went with her.

29
00:01:52.784 --> 00:01:55.556
"This is perfect!" thought Roxy.

30
00:01:55.557 --> 00:01:58.114
She flew in front of the robot.

31
00:01:58.115 --> 00:02:02.004
Using her x-ray vision, she looked into the robot.

32
00:02:02.005 --> 00:02:04.679
A small man sat inside its head.

33
00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:07.752
The man had a bald head and dark goggles.

34
00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:10.448
He wore a blue space suit.

35
00:02:10.449 --> 00:02:13.471
"Dr. Odd!" Roxy shouted.

36
00:02:13.472 --> 00:02:16.074
"You're not going to get away with this!"

37
00:02:16.075 --> 00:02:18.815
The evil villain was surprised to hear her.

38
00:02:18.816 --> 00:02:23.013
"Rocket Girl? Aargh!"

39
00:02:23.014 --> 00:02:27.998
Roxy bounced her bubble into the robot's face. Boing!

40
00:02:27.999 --> 00:02:32.537
"You can't stop me, Rocket Girl!" Dr. Odd yelled.

41
00:02:32.538 --> 00:02:36.702
"Not if you're trapped in that bubble! Ha-ha!"

42
00:02:36.703 --> 00:02:38.869
Dr. Odd pulled a lever.

43
00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.550
The robot knocked the bubble away.

44
00:02:41.551 --> 00:02:43.962
It raised its arm toward the bank.

45
00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:48.451
Roxy bounced the bubble off the robot again. Boing!

46
00:02:48.452 --> 00:02:52.376
"I won't let you steal that bank!" Roxy yelled.

47
00:02:52.377 --> 00:02:57.009
The robot waved its arm, knocking Roxy's bubble away again.

48
00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:01.734
Roxy kept moving her bubble in front of the robot.

49
00:03:01.735 --> 00:03:05.198
She could see Dr. Odd getting angry.

50
00:03:05.199 --> 00:03:08.843
"Get out of my way!" shouted Dr. Odd.

51
00:03:08.844 --> 00:03:11.347
"No!" Roxy shouted.

52
00:03:11.348 --> 00:03:14.373
"Aargh!" cried Dr. Odd.

53
00:03:14.374 --> 00:03:18.936
"I'll never steal the bank with this bubble in my way!"

54
00:03:18.937 --> 00:03:22.293
Dr. Odd pressed a button.

55
00:03:22.294 --> 00:03:26.648
The robot poked Roxy's bubble. Pop!

56
00:03:26.649 --> 00:03:31.882
"Now I'll finish you!" yelled Dr. Odd.

57
00:03:31.883 --> 00:03:38.240
The robot moved toward Roxy.
